   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-16): as legacy.**\n- 10 s is an **idle** limit (`URLRequest.timeoutInterval` semantics): no data for 10 s fails the request; a slow page that keeps receiving data is not cut.\n- Global search keeps legacy's extra **total** cap of 10 s (`timeoutIntervalForResource`, `Classes/ObjCForumSearchWorker.m:131-132` @ `2fe43da3`).\n- Background MP check unchanged (5 s).\nStatus → `ready`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
