   "body": "/claim cloud/i970-sonnet\n\nPlan (operator decision of 2026-11-16: idle 10 s, global search also a 10 s total cap, background 5 s):\n- Read the transport: is `withDeadline` a total limit today (it wraps the whole `session.data` call), and what does `HTTPRequest.timeout` mean for each preset.\n- Tests first on the loopback server: a stalled answer fails at the idle limit, a slow answer that keeps sending is not cut by the standard preset, global search is still cut by its 10 s total cap, background stays 5 s.\n- Make the standard deadline idle on Linux (corelibs ignores `timeoutInterval`): a deadline that restarts at each received chunk; set the presets to standard 10, topic search 10 (legacy `kTimeoutMaxi`), global search 10 idle + 10 total, background 5. Cite `Classes/Constants.h:70-72` and `Classes/ObjCForumSearchWorker.m:8,131-132` @ `2fe43da3`.\n- Update LOT-040's table and `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md` timeouts section; engine-only PR (no compile-check), Opus review, ready request on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
